---
import SectionHeader from "../ui/SectionHeader.astro";
import Card from "../ui/Card.astro";
---

<section class="py-24 relative" id="features-section" data-reveal>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <SectionHeader
      title="Construidas para"
      highlight="durar."
      description="Cada endpoint está pensado para ser confiable, rápido y transparente. Sin sorpresas ni límites artificiales, para que te enfoques en crear."
      align="split"
    />

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-12">
      <Card
        hoverEffect={false}
        class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2 flex flex-col md:flex-row h-full !p-0 overflow-hidden group border border-zinc-800/80 hover:border-zinc-700/80 bg-[#090a0b] hover:bg-[#0c0d0e] transition-all duration-300 relative"
      >
        <a
          href="/api"
          class="absolute inset-0 z-20"
          aria-label="Explorar endpoints de las APIs"></a>
        <div
          class="p-6 md:p-8 md:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-center relative z-10"
        >
          <span
            class="flex items-center gap-1.5 w-max font-mono text-[9px] text-[#f97316] uppercase tracking-widest border border-[#f97316]/20 bg-[#f97316]/5 px-2 py-1 rounded-md mb-4"
          >
            <span
              class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#f97316] animate-pulse shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(249,115,22,0.6)]"
            ></span>
            GET /velocidad
          </span>
          <h3
            class="text-xl font-medium text-zinc-100 mb-2 tracking-tight group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
          >
            Respuestas en milisegundos
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed text-[14px] group-hover:text-zinc-400 transition-colors"
          >
            Infraestructura optimizada para latencia mínima. Caché inteligente
            en el edge para que tus peticiones lleguen al instante sin retrasos
            artificiales.
          </p>

          <div
            class="mt-6 flex items-center text-[#f97316] text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-wide opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"
          >
            <span>Explorar endpoints</span>
            <i
              class="fas fa-arrow-right ml-2 text-[11px] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1.5"
              aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="relative w-full md:w-1/2 min-h-[200px] md:min-h-full bg-transparent border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-l border-zinc-800/50 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"
        >
          <svg
            width="400"
            height="300"
            viewBox="0 0 400 300"
            class="absolute inset-0 m-auto transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.03] scale-75 md:scale-90"
          >
            <g transform="scale(1, 0.5) rotate(45) translate(200, -200)">
              <rect
                x="-200"
                y="-200"
                width="400"
                height="400"
                stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.02)"
                stroke-width="1"
                fill="none"></rect>
              <path
                d="M-200 -100 L200 -100 M-200 0 L200 0 M-200 100 L200 100"
                stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.02)"></path>
              <path
                d="M-100 -200 L-100 200 M0 -200 L0 200 M100 -200 L100 200"
                stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.02)"></path>
            </g>
            <g stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" transform="translate(0, 50)">
              <path
                d="M -50 100 C 100 100, 150 150, 250 150 C 350 150, 400 100, 450 100"
                stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.1)"></path>
              <path
                d="M -50 130 C 100 130, 150 180, 250 180 C 350 180, 400 130, 450 130"
                stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.05)"></path>
              <path
                d="M -50 160 C 100 160, 150 110, 250 110 C 350 110, 400 160, 450 160"
                stroke="rgba(249,115,22,0.4)"></path>
              <circle cx="120" cy="122" r="3" fill="#f97316"></circle>
              <circle cx="280" cy="168" r="3" fill="#f97316"></circle>
              <circle cx="200" cy="126" r="3" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.5)"
              ></circle>
            </g>
            <text
              x="50"
              y="80"
              fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.05)"
              font-family="monospace"
              font-size="40"
              font-weight="bold">{}</text
            >
            <text
              x="320"
              y="240"
              fill="rgba(249,115,22,0.1)"
              font-family="monospace"
              font-size="50"
              font-weight="bold">&lt;/&gt;</text
            >
          </svg>
        </div>
      </Card>

      <Card
        hoverEffect={false}
        class="col-span-1 flex flex-col h-full !p-0 overflow-hidden group border border-zinc-800/80 hover:border-zinc-700/80 bg-[#090a0b] hover:bg-[#0c0d0e] transition-all duration-300 relative"
      >
        <a
          href="/api"
          class="absolute inset-0 z-20"
          aria-label="Cómo funciona la privacidad de las APIs"></a>
        <div
          class="relative w-full h-[180px] bg-transparent border-b border-zinc-800/50 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"
        >
          <svg
            width="280"
            height="240"
            viewBox="0 0 280 240"
            class="absolute inset-0 m-auto transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.03] scale-[0.85]"
          >
            <g transform="translate(140, 120)">
              <path
                d="M 0 -60 L 50 -40 L 50 20 C 50 50, 0 80, 0 80 C 0 80, -50 50, -50 20 L -50 -40 Z"
                stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.1)"
                stroke-width="1.5"
                fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.01)"></path>
              <path
                d="M 0 -45 L 35 -30 L 35 15 C 35 35, 0 60, 0 60 C 0 60, -35 35, -35 15 L -35 -30 Z"
                stroke="rgba(249,115,22,0.5)"
                stroke-width="1.5"
                fill="rgba(249,115,22,0.05)"></path>
              <text
                x="0"
                y="10"
                text-anchor="middle"
                fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.6)"
                font-family="monospace"
                font-size="30"
                font-weight="bold">{}</text
              >
              <path
                d="M -80 -20 L -60 -20 M 60 -20 L 80 -20 M -90 10 L -65 10 M 65 10 L 90 10"
                stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.05)"
                stroke-width="2"
                stroke-dasharray="4 4"></path>
            </g>
          </svg>

          <div class="absolute top-4 left-5">
            <span
              class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-[9px] text-[#f97316] uppercase tracking-widest border border-[#f97316]/20 bg-[#f97316]/5 px-2 py-1 rounded-md"
            >
              <span
                class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#f97316] animate-pulse shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(249,115,22,0.6)]"
              ></span>
              POST /privacidad
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 flex flex-col grow">
          <h3
            class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100 mb-2 tracking-tight group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
          >
            Privacidad por diseño
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed text-[13px] group-hover:text-zinc-400 transition-colors"
          >
            Tus datos se quedan entre tú y la API. No recopilamos información
            personal ni guardamos logs de tus peticiones.
          </p>

          <div
            class="mt-auto pt-6 flex items-center text-[#f97316] text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-wide opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"
          >
            <span>Cómo funciona</span>
            <i
              class="fas fa-arrow-right ml-2 text-[11px] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1.5"
              aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Card>

      <Card
        hoverEffect={false}
        class="col-span-1 flex flex-col h-full !p-0 overflow-hidden group border border-zinc-800/80 hover:border-zinc-700/80 bg-[#090a0b] hover:bg-[#0c0d0e] transition-all duration-300 relative"
      >
        <a
          href="/actualizaciones"
          class="absolute inset-0 z-20"
          aria-label="Ver changelog de actualizaciones"></a>
        <div
          class="relative w-full h-[180px] bg-transparent border-b border-zinc-800/50 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"
        >
          <svg
            width="280"
            height="240"
            viewBox="0 0 280 240"
            class="absolute inset-0 m-auto transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.03] scale-[0.85]"
          >
            <g transform="translate(140, 120)">
              <g stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.15)" stroke-width="1" fill="none">
                <!-- Lines -->
                <path d="M 0 -40 L 40 -10 L 20 40 L -20 40 L -40 -10 Z"></path>
                <path d="M 0 -40 L 0 0 L 40 -10"></path>
                <path d="M 0 0 L 20 40"></path>
                <path d="M 0 0 L -20 40"></path>
                <path d="M 0 0 L -40 -10"></path>

                <!-- Center Node (Orange) -->
                <circle
                  cx="0"
                  cy="0"
                  r="6"
                  stroke="#f97316"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  fill="rgba(249,115,22,0.2)"></circle>
                <!-- Outer Nodes -->
                <circle cx="0" cy="-40" r="4" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)"
                ></circle>
                <circle cx="40" cy="-10" r="4" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)"
                ></circle>
                <circle cx="20" cy="40" r="4" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)"
                ></circle>
                <circle cx="-20" cy="40" r="4" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)"
                ></circle>
                <circle cx="-40" cy="-10" r="4" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)"
                ></circle>

                <!-- Data packets -->
                <circle cx="20" cy="-5" r="2" fill="#f97316"></circle>
                <circle cx="-10" cy="20" r="2" fill="#f97316"></circle>
              </g>

              <!-- Faded background nodes -->
              <g
                stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.05)"
                stroke-width="1"
                fill="none"
                transform="scale(1.5) rotate(15)"
              >
                <path d="M 0 -40 L 40 -10 L 20 40 L -20 40 L -40 -10 Z"></path>
                <circle cx="0" cy="-40" r="2"></circle>
                <circle cx="40" cy="-10" r="2"></circle>
              </g>
            </g>
          </svg>

          <div class="absolute top-4 left-5">
            <span
              class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-[9px] text-[#f97316] uppercase tracking-widest border border-[#f97316]/20 bg-[#f97316]/5 px-2 py-1 rounded-md"
            >
              <span
                class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#f97316] animate-pulse shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(249,115,22,0.6)]"
              ></span>
              WS //evolucion
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 flex flex-col grow">
          <h3
            class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100 mb-2 tracking-tight group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
          >
            Siempre evolucionando
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed text-[13px] group-hover:text-zinc-400 transition-colors"
          >
            Endpoints actualizados continuamente. Añadimos funciones guiados por
            las sugerencias de la comunidad en Discord.
          </p>

          <div
            class="mt-auto pt-6 flex items-center text-[#f97316] text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-wide opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"
          >
            <span>Ver changelog</span>
            <i
              class="fas fa-arrow-right ml-2 text-[11px] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1.5"
              aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
